.*
.* WRKJOBSCDE: the job schedule's entries, laid out as the V7R1M0
.* capture (golden/verified/oracle71/panels).
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NBRCL BASETYPE='CHAR 6'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 4'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=DATECL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FRQCL BASETYPE='CHAR 9'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=RCYCL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=JOB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=STATUS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=SDATE CLASS=DATECL.
:VAR NAME=STIME CLASS=DATECL.
:VAR NAME=FRQ CLASS=FRQCL.
:VAR NAME=RCYACN CLASS=RCYCL.
:VAR NAME=NXTDATE CLASS=DATECL.
:VAR NAME=TEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=ENTRY CLASS=NBRCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=ENTRIES VARS='OPT JOB STATUS SDATE STIME FRQ RCYACN NXTDATE TEXT ENTRY'.
:KEYL NAME=SCDKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION='CMD ?ADDJOBSCDE'.F6=Add
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display job queue data
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKJOBSCDE KEYL=SCDKEYS HELP=WRKJOBSCDE ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=DATETIME.Work with Job Schedule Entries
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAC.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=ENTRIES.(No job schedule entries to display)
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGJOBSCDE JOB(&JOB.) ENTRYNBR(&ENTRY.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ENTER='CMD HLDJOBSCDE JOB(&JOB.) ENTRYNBR(&ENTRY.)'.3=Hold
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD RMVJOBSCDE JOB(&JOB.) ENTRYNBR(&ENTRY.)'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD WRKJOBSCDE JOB(&JOB.) OUTPUT(*PRINT)'.5=Display details
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD RLSJOBSCDE JOB(&JOB.) ENTRYNBR(&ENTRY.)'.6=Release
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD WRKSBMJOB'.8=Work with last submission
:LISTACT OPTION=10 ENTER='CMD SBMJOB CMD(CALL QCMD) JOB(&JOB.)'.10=Submit immediately
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:LISTCOL VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTGRP COL=SCHED.-----Schedule------
:LISTCOL VAR=SDATE USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=27.Date
:LISTCOL VAR=STIME USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=38.Time
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTCOL VAR=FRQ USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=48.Frequency
:LISTCOL VAR=RCYACN USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=59.Recovery Action
:LISTCOL VAR=NXTDATE USAGE=OUTPUT ATCOL=69.Next Submit Date
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT JOB STATUS SCHED FRQ RCYACN NXTDATE'.
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKJOBSCDE.Work with Job Schedule Entries - Help
:P.The jobs the schedule submits, with when each runs next and how
often. F6 adds an entry.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
